{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06D7C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Peace Walker采用的双足步行技术，参考了东方阵营的研究。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"……不，还是说实话吧。基础构想大半都是我盗用来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"东方阵营……双足步行……难道是Granin？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"你认识他？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯。我在苏联的研究所见过他，也受过他一点照顾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"见过？你到底……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"他是Granin设计局的局长，设计过许多苏联武器……如果是他的研究，那就说得通了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当时我的研究正碰上瓶颈……Granin的构想几乎把那些问题全解决了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"参考别人的研究成果，再发展自己的研究，这并不奇怪吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"只要注明出处就没问题。但我当时根本不可能这么做。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"他的研究属于最高级别的军事机密，而且还是敌国的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以你就瞒着所有人用了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"我只是想让学界那帮人看看我的本事！……那些一直嘲笑我的家伙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"不过，也是我自作自受。Coldman抓住了这个把柄，说如果我退出Peace Walker研究，就把盗用的事抖出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":133,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"你被他套住了啊，博士。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""}]}